I felt like I understood what the enemy was going to do.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.700
It's the same thing I felt back then.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.870
The same feeling when I touched Desil...{ewwww}

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.120
Flit, watch out!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.210
Pay attention!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.880
