00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:02.380
Flit Asuno. You disappoint me.

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.470
I'm bored. Time to go home.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:46.470
Desil... Just who are you?

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.150
Desil!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.150
You can have it back.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:03.950
Desil?

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.410
I hope we see each other again, Flit.

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:13.080
If you survive that long, that is.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.500
Bye bye!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.420
Desil!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.480
We can't have you acting on your own like this, Desil.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.020
You found out already, huh?

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:42.070
Since you have been accepted as a dweller of EDEN, you must not associate with those people.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:45.280
I thought they'd be more interesting.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.990
