00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.270
If I had it, could I become stronger?

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:21.310
Flit...

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:25.070
Flit's getting further and further away from me.

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:50.840
koboreochita namida ga kyou mo hoshi ni nari

